5662188296112","url":"https://mastodon.social/@sfscon/117585662188296112","replies_count":0,"reblogs_count":2,"favourites_count":5,"quotes_count":1,"edited_at":null,"content":"<p>🚀Are you ready, Free Open Source Software community?</p><p>The wait is almost over: <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/SFSCON26\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>SFSCON26</span></a> starts this Friday!</p><p>Two days of talks, panels, workshops, hacking, and conversations about <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/OpenSource\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>OpenSource</span></a>, <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/FreeSoftware\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>FreeSoftware</span></a>, <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/DigitalSovereignty\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>DigitalSovereignty</span></a> and innovation.</p><p>🎟️ Secure your spot now: <a href=\"https://www.sfscon.it/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://www.</span><span class=\"\">sfscon.it/</span><span class=\"invisible\"></span></a></p><p>See you in Bolzano!💙</p>","reblog":null,"application":{"name":"Web","website":null},"account":{"id":"117274497215947314","username":"sfscon","acct":"sfscon","display_name":"SFSCON","locked":false,"bot":false,"discoverable":null,"indexable":false,"group":false,"created_at":"2026-09-15T00:00:00.000Z","note":"<p>🌍 Europe&#39;s meeting point for the Free and Open Source Software community.<br />📍 Bolzano/Bozen, Italy<br />🐧 Bringing together communities, developers and changemakers since 2001.</p><p><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/SFSCON\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>SFSCON</span></a>  <a href=\"https://mastodon.social/tags/SFSCON26\" class=\"mention hashtag\" rel=\"tag\">#<span>SFSCON26</span></a></p>","url":"https://mastodon.social/@sfscon","uri":"https://mastodon.social/ap/users/117274497215947314","avatar":"https://files.mastodon.social/account